OL,3,GNEWSAReview into Welsh transgender
OL,4,Asurgery must be quick, first minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FA review into surgery services at
OL,8,FWales' only transgender clinic must be
OL,9,Fquick, First Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FThe Welsh Gender Service paused surgery
OL,13,Flast week after concerns from an NHS
OL,14,Fcommittee about the number of referrals
OL,15,Fand whether they were all appropriate.
OL,17,FWhile Reform UK Wales and the Welsh
OL,18,FConservative Party had expressed
OL,19,Fsupport, Plaid Cymru had raised
OL,20,Fconcerns about the decision on social
OL,21,Fmedia.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
