OL,3,GNEWSAReview into Welsh transgender
OL,4,Asurgery must be quick, first minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlaid leader ap Iorwerth said while the
OL,8,Fcommittee at the heart of the row had
OL,9,Ftaken the decision "for the right
OL,10,Freason" on service quality grounds, he
OL,11,Fwould be "pressing for answers" on the
OL,12,Fintervention.
